# DustSettling regression test
#
# Tests Phase 11 Stokes settling: apply_dust_settling_to_cc_source called
# from ERF_Advance after dust injection (Phase 10).
#
# Pattern: follows apply_fire_tendency_to_cc_source in
#   Source/Fire/ERF_FireAtmCoupling.H
#
# Configuration:
#   8x8x16 cells, 1000x1000x1000 m domain. dz = 62.5 m per cell.
#   Geostrophic wind 10 m/s. MRF diagnoses u* > u*_t = 0.05 m/s.
#   After Phase 10 injection, dust is present at k=0. Phase 11 settling
#   moves mass downward each step.
#   transport_bins_separately = false: single scalar slot, bin 0 diameter.
#   bin_diameters[0] = 7e-6 m (PM10 coarse mode).
#   max_step = 5.
#
# Stokes settling velocity for bin 0 (d=7 um):
#   v_s = (2650-1.225)*9.81*(7e-6)^2/(18*1.81e-5)
#       = 2648.775*9.81*4.9e-11/3.258e-4
#       approx 3.9e-3 m/s
# Cunningham correction C_c for d=7 um:
#   ratio = 2*6.6e-8/7e-6 = 0.01886
#   C_c = 1 + 0.01886*(1.257 + 0.4*exp(-0.55*7e-6/6.6e-8))
#       = 1 + 0.01886*1.257 = approx 1.024
#   v_s_corrected approx 4.0e-3 m/s
#
# Expected results:
#   (1) [DUST SETTLING] line printed each step with v_s approx 4e-3 m/s.
#   (2) [DUST DEBUG] Phase 11 line printed each step.
#   (3) cc_source at RhoAdv_comp, k=0 has negative settling tendency
#       (mass leaves k=0 downward).
#   (4) cc_source at RhoAdv_comp, k=1 has positive settling tendency
#       (mass arrives from k=0).
#   (5) Column integral of RhoDust * dz does not increase (no production
#       from settling; only redistribution and Phase 10 injection).
#   (6) Setting erf.dust.atm_feedback = 0 produces zero settling tendency
#       (no dust in 3D to settle).
#   (7) Run exits with code 0.
#
# References:
#   Stokes (1851). Trans. Cambridge Phil. Soc., 9, 8-106.
#   Allen & Raabe (1985). Aerosol Sci. Tech., 4, 269-286.
#     https://doi.org/10.1080/02786828508959055
#   Seinfeld & Pandis (2006). Atmospheric Chemistry and Physics, ch. 9.
#     ISBN 978-0-471-72018-8.
#   Ginoux et al. (2001). J. Geophys. Res., 106, 20255.
#     https://doi.org/10.1029/2000JD901323
#   ERF_FireAtmCoupling.H (pattern reference):
#     https://github.com/hgopalan/ERF/blob/7856affedd8bb3c878b62c308f39c36bf2228791/
#     Source/Fire/ERF_FireAtmCoupling.H

